      "level": 2,
      "content": "3.2 Hirakud Dam"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The Hirakud Dam on the Mahanadi River (Sambalpur district) is one of the longest earthen dams in the world. It was the first major multipurpose river valley project in independent India.",
      "id": "wq2owa0"
    },
